SCOPE / 适用范围

The MIT license above covers only the ORIGINAL work of this project: the ArkTS
application code, the clean-room `meow.launcher`, the self-written native
bridges (`libmeowcraftbridge.so` / `libmeowjrebridge.so` / `libmeowassets.so`),
the build tooling under `tools/`, and other files that carry no third-party
copyright notice.

It does NOT cover bundled or prebuilt third-party components, which remain
under their own licenses (see `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`), including but not
limited to:

  * OpenJDK / JRE                      — GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-Exception
  * OpenAL Soft                        — LGPL-2.0-or-later
  * FreeType                           — FreeType License (FTL)
  * LWJGL (3.3.3 / 3.4.3 / 2.9.3)      — BSD-3-Clause
  * SDL3 (fork)                        — Zlib
  * shaderc / SPIRV-Cross / SPIRV-Tools / SPIRV-Headers / glslang — Apache-2.0 (…)
  * gl4es, oshi, libffi                — MIT
  * gson (shaded)                      — Apache-2.0
  * stb, tinyfiledialogs               — Public Domain / MIT / Zlib

Several of our files are DERIVATIVES of third-party works (the LWJGL GLFW
overlay and GLCapabilities, the SDL `ohos` driver, the OpenAL OHAudio backend,
the oshi/gl4es patches). Those files remain under their upstream licenses and
may NOT be relicensed under MIT.

